########### APPOINTMENTS ############

### Registered user books (with token)
POST {{Clinic_HostAddress}}/api/appointment/book
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ 
  "doctorId": 3, 
  "appointmentDate": "2026-05-20T10:00:00", 
  "durationMinutes": 45, 
  "appointmentCategoryId": 2
}

### Book appointment as GUEST (no auth required)
POST {{Clinic_HostAddress}}/api/appointment/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-05-20T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "appointmentCategoryId": 1,
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "birthdate": "1990-01-15T00:00:00"
}

### Move appointment (requires auth)
POST {{Clinic_HostAddress}}/api/appointment/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "appointmentId": 3,
  "newAppointmentDate": "2026-05-25T14:00:00",
  "newDurationMinutes": 45
}

### Get my appointments (requires auth)
GET {{Clinic_HostAddress}}/api/appointment/my-appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cancel appointment (requires auth)
POST {{Clinic_HostAddress}}/api/appointment/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}